        "occult"
      ],
      "text": "Any living, non-elf creature hit by a ghoul gnawer's attack must succeed at a DC 27 Fortitude save save or become Paralyzed. The creature can attempt a new save at the end of each of its turns, and the DC cumulatively decreases by 1 on each such save."
